# Locale override: keep API documentation field labels in English.
#
# The site language is zh_CN (for project-level HLD pages), but the API
# reference pages (docs/03_reference/api.md, rendered by Breathe from
# Doxygen XML) are English content. Sphinx would otherwise translate the
# docutils field labels (e.g. "Parameters" -> "参数"). The entries below
# pin those labels back to English without touching any other part of
# the site translation.
#
# Compiled product: sphinx.mo (keep both files committed so CI renders
# identically without needing gettext tools).
